{
  "id": "power",
  "title": "Power Calculator",
  "description": "Calculate power based on work and time, or force and velocity. Power is the rate at which work is done or energy is converted.",
  "type": "calculator-chart",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "# Power Calculator\n\nPower is a measure of the rate at which work is done or energy is converted.\n\n**Formula 1:** P = W / dt (Power from Work and Time)\n**Formula 2:** P = F × v (Power from Force and Velocity)\n**Formula 3:** P = E / dt (Power from Energy and Time)\n\nwhere:\n- P = power (W)\n- W = work done (J)\n- E = energy converted (J)\n- dt = time (s)\n- F = force (N)\n- v = velocity (m/s)"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "calculationType",
          "label": "Calculation Type",
          "type": "select",
          "options": [
            {
              "label": "Power from Work and Time",
              "value": "work"
            },
            {
              "label": "Power from Force and Velocity",
              "value": "force"
            },
            {
              "label": "Power from Energy and Time",
              "value": "energy"
            },
            {
              "label": "Time from Work and Power",
              "value": "time"
            },
            {
              "label": "Work from Power and Time",
              "value": "workFromPower"
            }
          ],
          "defaultValue": "work"
        },
        {
          "id": "work",
          "label": "Work Done",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "J",
          "defaultValue": 98100
        },
        {
          "id": "time",
          "label": "Time",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "s",
          "defaultValue": 10
        },
        {
          "id": "force",
          "label": "Force",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "N",
          "defaultValue": 981
        },
        {
          "id": "velocity",
          "label": "Velocity",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "m/s",
          "defaultValue": 10
        },
        {
          "id": "energy",
          "label": "Energy Converted",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "J",
          "defaultValue": 3600000
        },
        {
          "id": "power",
          "label": "Power",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "W",
          "defaultValue": 1000
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "powerOutput",
          "label": "Power",
          "unit": "W",
          "format": "decimal",
          "formula": "IF(inputs.calculationType = 'work', inputs.work / inputs.time, IF(inputs.calculationType = 'force', inputs.force * inputs.velocity, IF(inputs.calculationType = 'energy', inputs.energy / inputs.time, '')))"
        },
        {
          "id": "powerKw",
          "label": "Power",
          "unit": "kW",
          "format": "decimal",
          "formula": "(IF(inputs.calculationType = 'work', inputs.work / inputs.time, IF(inputs.calculationType = 'force', inputs.force * inputs.velocity, IF(inputs.calculationType = 'energy', inputs.energy / inputs.time, '')))) / 1000"
        },
        {
          "id": "powerHp",
          "label": "Power",
          "unit": "hp",
          "format": "decimal",
          "formula": "(IF(inputs.calculationType = 'work', inputs.work / inputs.time, IF(inputs.calculationType = 'force', inputs.force * inputs.velocity, IF(inputs.calculationType = 'energy', inputs.energy / inputs.time, '')))) / 745.7"
        },
        {
          "id": "timeOutput",
          "label": "Time Required",
          "unit": "s",
          "format": "decimal",
          "formula": "IF(inputs.calculationType = 'time', inputs.work / inputs.power, '')"
        },
        {
          "id": "workOutput",
          "label": "Work Done",
          "unit": "J",
          "format": "decimal",
          "formula": "IF(inputs.calculationType = 'workFromPower', inputs.power * inputs.time, '')"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
